{{!
    @template local_dimensions/central/structures_menu

    The Competencies tab's Structures menu: the commands that are not about one framework. New structure
    and Import from CSV run the Structures tab's own dialogues (amd/src/central/frameworks.js), offered to
    whoever manages competencies in the tab's context; "Show hidden structures" is a menuitemcheckbox over
    the tab's saved toggle; "Manage scales" is the scales page's link, for whoever may open it.

    Core's dropdown (Bootstrap's data API, 5.x spelling): its arrow keys, Escape and the press outside are
    Bootstrap's; auto-close "outside" keeps the menu open while the check box is toggled, and
    amd/src/central/structure.js closes it before an action opens its dialogue.

    Context variables required (inside structuresmenu):
    * cancreate (bool) · canscalespage (bool) · scalesurl (string) · hashidden (bool) · showhidden (bool)
    * sepbeforehidden (bool) · sepbeforescales (bool) · whether a separator precedes the group

    Example context (json):
    {
        "structuresmenu": {
            "cancreate": true, "canscalespage": true, "scalesurl": "https://example.com/grade/edit/scale/index.php",
            "hashidden": true, "showhidden": false, "sepbeforehidden": true, "sepbeforescales": true
        }
    }
}}
{{#structuresmenu}}
<div class="dropdown local-dimensions-central-structmenu" data-region="structures-menu">
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary local-dimensions-central-structmenu-trigger"
            id="local-dimensions-structures-trigger" data-bs-toggle="dropdown" data-bs-auto-close="outside"
            aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false">
        <i class="fa fa-sitemap me-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>{{#str}}central_frameworks_tab, local_dimensions{{/str}}<i class="fa fa-chevron-down ms-1" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    </button>
    <div class="dropdown-menu dropdown-menu-end local-dimensions-central-structmenu-list" role="menu"
         aria-labelledby="local-dimensions-structures-trigger">
        {{#cancreate}}
        <button type="button" class="dropdown-item local-dimensions-central-structmenu-item" role="menuitem" data-action="structures-new">
            <i class="fa fa-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>{{#str}}central_frameworks_new, local_dimensions{{/str}}</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="dropdown-item local-dimensions-central-structmenu-item" role="menuitem" data-action="structures-import">
            <i class="fa fa-upload" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>{{#str}}hubv2_structures_import, local_dimensions{{/str}}</span>
        </button>
        {{/cancreate}}
        {{#hashidden}}
        {{#sepbeforehidden}}<hr class="dropdown-divider">{{/sepbeforehidden}}
        <button type="button" class="dropdown-item local-dimensions-central-structmenu-item" role="menuitemcheckbox"
                aria-checked="{{#showhidden}}true{{/showhidden}}{{^showhidden}}false{{/showhidden}}" data-action="structures-showhidden">
            <span class="local-dimensions-central-structmenu-box" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa fa-check"></i></span><span>{{#str}}managecompetencies_showhiddenframeworks, local_dimensions{{/str}}</span>
        </button>
        {{/hashidden}}
        {{#canscalespage}}
        {{#sepbeforescales}}<hr class="dropdown-divider">{{/sepbeforescales}}
        <a class="dropdown-item local-dimensions-central-structmenu-item" role="menuitem" href="{{scalesurl}}">
            <i class="fa fa-scale-balanced" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>{{#str}}hubv2_structures_scales, local_dimensions{{/str}}</span>
        </a>
        {{/canscalespage}}
    </div>
</div>
{{/structuresmenu}}
